# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the conformance suite and the samples
# (mrhi-0003). Lavapipe runs its rasterizer on threads of its own,
# compiles shaders with LLVM and presents through the XCB client
# library, and the Khronos validation layer checks submissions on a
# thread of its own, all built without ThreadSanitizer, which cannot see
# how they order their threads and locks; they are not the driver's to
# check. The layer's thread was seen holding a lock of a swapchain's
# state as the layer freed it, the queue already idle.
called_from_lib:libvulkan_lvp.so
called_from_lib:libLLVM
called_from_lib:libxcb.so
called_from_lib:libVkLayer_khronos_validation.so
